   $q$Which heading tells where to read about how leaves end up on the ground?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Shorter Days","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-section"},{"text":"Bright Reds","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-section"},{"text":"Falling Down","is_correct":true},{"text":"Green All Summer","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-section"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Falling Down$q$, $q$The "Falling Down" section explains the thin layer that cuts the leaf off so it drops. "Shorter Days" explains color changes, not how leaves fall.$q$, 'draft', 'f0b92e42-b46a-531c-be39-f19d95fe2a99')
