insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('a3a465be-15f0-50f0-a88f-9e2389739a4a', 'rg3-theme-summary-p01', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g3-theme-summary'), null,
        '3-5', $q$The Squirrel and the Chipmunk$q$, $q$In the fall, Squirrel worked hard. Every day, Squirrel gathered acorns and piled them under a big oak tree. Soon the pile was taller than a mushroom.

One cold morning, Chipmunk came by. "My nuts got wet and moldy," Chipmunk said. "May I have a few of your acorns?"

Squirrel puffed up its tail. "No! I worked for these. Go find your own." Chipmunk walked away slowly.

That night, a big storm blew through the forest. Rain poured down, and a stream of water rushed under the oak tree. It carried Squirrel's whole pile away.

In the morning, Squirrel sat by the empty spot, shivering and hungry. Then Chipmunk appeared with a small bag of seeds.

"I found these under a rock," Chipmunk said. "There are enough for both of us."

Squirrel's ears turned pink. "I would not share with you, but you are sharing with me. Thank you, friend."

When spring came, Squirrel and Chipmunk gathered food together. They kept one pile, and they always made sure there was enough for anyone who asked.$q$, 'draft')
