-- Passage rg3-theme-summary-p05
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('17cfe846-c625-52b6-9cac-397efd5bba2b', 'rg3-theme-summary-p05', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g3-theme-summary'), null,
        '3-5', $q$Pass It On$q$, $q$Diego was the fastest runner on the Blue Hawks soccer team. Every time Diego got the ball, Diego ran straight for the goal and kicked.

In the first half of Saturday's game, Diego took six shots. The goalie on the other team stopped every one. Each time, Diego's teammates were wide open, waving their arms. "Pass!" Mei called. But Diego kept the ball.

At halftime, the Blue Hawks were losing by two goals. Diego sat on the bench and stared at the grass.

Coach Harlow knelt down. "You are a great runner," the coach said. "But the other team knows you will shoot. They are all watching you. Who are they not watching?"

Diego looked at Mei and Jonah and the rest of the team. "Everyone else," Diego said.

In the second half, Diego ran up the field with the ball again. Three players rushed over. This time, Diego kicked the ball sideways to Mei. Mei passed to Jonah, and Jonah tapped it into the net.

The Blue Hawks scored two more goals the same way. The game ended in a tie.

On the way home, Diego was smiling. "I did not score one goal today," Diego said. "But our team scored three."$q$, 'draft')
