   $q$Why is Diego smiling at the end, even without scoring a goal?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Diego is glad the game is over and wants to go home.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Diego now cares more about the team's goals than personal goals.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Diego thinks the coach will let Diego shoot more next time.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Diego scored all three of the team's goals in the second half.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Diego now cares more about the team's goals than personal goals.$q$, $q$Diego says, "I did not score one goal today. But our team scored three," which shows the lesson has been learned. Diego's teammates scored the goals, not Diego.$q$, 'draft', '17cfe846-c625-52b6-9cac-397efd5bba2b')
