   $q$The passage says, "Many kites are colorful." What does "colorful" mean?$q$, $q$[{"text":"one plain color","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"ignores-suffix"},{"text":"colored again","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"invents-affix-meaning"},{"text":"without color","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-ful-with-less"},{"text":"full of color","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$full of color$q$, $q$The suffix -ful means "full of," so "colorful" means full of color, and the next sentence names "bright red, yellow and blue." "Without color" would be "colorless."$q$, 'draft', 'f4d5169c-9aee-55a5-9b4a-0a44d09c886e')
