   $q$What is the author's opinion?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Only students who love music should join the band.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Every fourth grader should learn to play an instrument.","is_correct":true},{"text":"School concerts should be held more often each year.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Families should buy their children new instruments.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Every fourth grader should learn to play an instrument.$q$, $q$The author says, "I think every fourth grader should learn to play an instrument." Concerts are mentioned only as one reason music is fun.$q$, 'draft', 'ee3083a3-8644-5269-922a-551473d4f825')
